error[E0520]: duplicate 'get' accessor for 'count'
 --> $DIR/duplicate.nra:6:11
  |
4 |         | get: count;
  |           --- the first 'get' accessor is here
5 |         | set: count = value;
6 |         | get: count + 1;
  |           ^^^ a second 'get' accessor
  |
  = help: remove one of them; a field has at most one 'get' and one 'set' accessor

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0520`.
